  "sourceOfTruthNotes": "Canonical learner content is workspace/index.html, course-data.json, main.js, state-store.js, CSS and assets. course-data.js is compiled from canonical course-data.json with the declared command. Routine lesson text is static HTML with Studio edit keys; generated practice, textbook controls and saved-work panels are Annotation only. The frozen previous-draft catalog and original archives are reference evidence. Blocked review candidate; Edit/export disabled. The original textbook-page JPGs remain canonical source scans; assets/reader-pages/ are deterministic margin-trimmed display copies regenerated with readerPageRegenerateCommand. Question-level Textbook Practice crops, its browser overlay and its review manifest regenerate from the canonical textbook/page catalog with scripts/build-science24-textbook-practice.py. The overlay freezes the earlier page catalog as legacyBookQuestions so original saved page records remain visible and are never counted as replacement question work. Printed/PDF page mapping and accessible text remain unchanged.",
